<title>ITALY: SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT BOSNIA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT BOSNIA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia beat Bosnia 4-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in a European Group One World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match played in Italy on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bosnia - Hasan Salihamidzic (25th minute)</p>
<p>Croatia - Slaven Bilic (14th), Goran Vlaovic (32nd), Alen</p>
<p>Boksic (63rd, 84th).</p>
<p>Group one standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for,against, points):</p>
<p>Greece		  2   2   0   0   5   0   6</p>
<p> Croatia		 1   1   0   0   4   1   3</p>
<p> Denmark		 1   1   0   0   2   0   3</p>
<p> Slovenia		2   0   0   2   0   4   0</p>
<p> Bosnia		  2   0   0   2   1   7   0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 9 Denmark v Greece</p>
</text>
